# AVKit, CoreVideo, HIServices, ImageIO, OpenGL and Quartz are HELD BACK. Their objects
# compile; the link wants CoreGraphics symbols (CGDisplayCopyDisplayMode and friends) that
# come from COCOTRON's CoreGraphics, which the reference links as
# src/external/cocotron/CoreGraphics/CoreGraphics. That whole cone -- cocotron's
# CoreGraphics, CoreText, Onyx2D and QuartzCore -- is unported and belongs to the
# src/external group rather than to the frameworks, so these six unblock when it lands
# rather than through anything in this package.

